      Purpose: General dynamic SQL procedure that takes in a sql query as a string
               and a list of parameters used to do binding.  Maximum of 25 bind
               parameters can be passed.  Using this method until 11g and can
               generate a ref cursor out of a dynamic DBMS_SQL query.
